{"id":"excepcio_n","lemma":"excepción","pos":"noun","rank":2701,"glosses":["exception"],"ipa":"/eɡsθebˈθjon/","gender":"f","forms":{"plural":"excepciones"},"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/3/30/LL-Q1321_%28spa%29-AdrianAbdulBaha-excepci%C3%B3n.wav","examples":[{"text":"Esta regla no tiene excepciones.","en":"This rule has no exceptions.","audio":"https://tatoeba.org/en/audio/download/330763","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"rule"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"tener"},null]},{"text":"Es la regla, no la excepción.","en":"It's the rule, not the exception.","words":[{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"rule"},{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"the / her"},null]},{"text":"No hay reglas sin excepciones.","en":"There are no rules without exceptions.","words":[{"g":"no / not"},{"g":"to have","l":"haber"},{"g":"rule","l":"regla"},{"g":"without"},null]},{"text":"Haremos una excepción en su caso.","en":"We'll make an exception of your case.","words":[{"g":"to do","l":"hacer"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"in / on"},{"g":"his / her / your"},{"g":"case"}]},{"text":"Esta es una excepción a la regla.","en":"This is an exception to the rule.","words":[{"g":"this","l":"este"},{"g":"to be","l":"ser"},{"g":"a"},null,{"g":"to"},{"g":"the / her"},{"g":"rule"}]}]}